            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Cao Bang Nguyen Hong",
            "review_text": "Lee C\n1 contribution\n1\nSpecial tastes in Ha Noi\nOct 2018 • Couples\nIf you want try something different delicacie in HA Noi city. This place is recommend for you. Tradition dishes from Cao Bang where almost ethnic minority people. With strange taste ,cozy asmostphere and friendly owner it really good to take a try. \nBy the way , the price was reasonable :)\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 13, 2018\nkimp251\nDear Mr Lee\n\nThank you very much for your taking time to rate us on trip advisor, we were very happy to know that you satisfied with our food, hopefully we have a chance to serve you in near future. we wish you always happy and succes in life \n\nThe best Regards, \nAnthony\nRead more\nWritten October 17, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
