            "review_text": "Toan T\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n1\nBanh cuon Cao Bang MR.ÂN THe Best!!!\nOct 2018 • Solo\nI was recommended by one of my friends Mr Anthony and went on to check this brand new out. I was totally fascinated by the way it was made. Since, tried once then another until full of stomach!!. It was beautiful, historical in the way that the tongue can taste and I loved it. \nWould highly recommend to anyone who haven't tried.\n\n#a-must-do, #must-eat in Hanoi\nRead more\nWritten October 12, 2018\nkimp251\nDear Mr Toan\n\nThank you very much for your review, we were very happy to know that you love our food. Your nice word will help us get more energy and passion to make our food better day by day. We wish you with good health and happy in life \n\nSincerely \nAnthony\nRead more\nWritten October 17, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
